gjian_id":"bca70136-db0e-11ef-9726-a0d3651f611f"},{"link_death_year":718,"link_td_description":"李失活，是契丹大贺氏首领，唐朝松漠都督府都督，窟哥的孙子，李尽忠的堂弟。","link_td_id":"Q10010451","link_td_number_id":1054835,"people_name":"李失活","people_name_jianti_auto":"李失活","people_xingming":"李失活","start_index":5,"tongjian_id":"bca70137-db0e-11ef-b0b5-a0d3651f611f"},{"link_death_year":720,"link_td_description":"李娑固，是契丹大贺氏首领，唐朝松漠都督府都督，窟哥的孙子，李失活的堂弟。","link_td_id":"Q10010447","link_td_number_id":1054836,"people_name":"娑固","people_name_jianti_auto":"娑固","people_xingming":"娑固","start_index":16,"tongjian_id":"bca70138-db0e-11ef-89cd-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_pinyin":[],"ExtRef_Children_places":[],"ExtRef_Children_topics":[{"title":"唐攻契丹之战","tongjian_id":"war_N1001"}],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"background_material_references":[],"class_tags":["人事"],"content":"10契丹王李失活卒，癸巳，以其弟娑固代之。","content_fanyi":"契丹王李失活去世，癸巳日，以其弟娑固接替他当契丹王。","content_jianti_auto":"10契丹王李失活卒，癸巳，以其弟娑固代之。","dtjl_paragraph_links":[],"dtjl_references":[],"id":21224,"number":10,"reading_annotation_sources":[],"start_index":9,"tongjian_id":"bca70134-db0e-11ef-9a5e-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_companion_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_decisions":[],"ExtRef_Children_hu_notes":[{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[],"ExtRef_Children_places":[{"place_name":"唐","place_name_jianti_auto":"唐","start_index":0,"tongjian_id":"bca77708-db0e-11ef-b591-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"唐鄕飲酒之禮，刺史爲主人，先召致仕鄕有德者謀之，賢者爲賓，其次爲介，其次爲衆賓，與之行禮。縣則令爲主人，鄕之老人年六十以上有德望者一人爲賓，次一人爲介，又其次爲三賓，又其次爲衆賓。年六十者三豆，七十者四豆，八十者五豆，九十者及主人皆六豆。主、賓、介、三賓、衆賓旣升，卽席，工持瑟升自階就位，鼓鹿鳴。卒歌，笙入立於堂下北面，奏南陔。乃間歌，歌南有嘉魚，笙崇丘，乃合樂周南·關雎、召南·鵲巢。司正升自西階，贊禮，揚觶，而戒之以忠孝之本，主、賓、介以下皆再拜。奠酬旣畢，乃行無算爵，無算樂。","note_content_jianti_auto":"唐鄕饮酒之礼，刺史为主人，先召致仕鄕有德者谋之，贤者为宾，其次为介，其次为众宾，与之行礼。县则令为主人，鄕之老人年六十以上有德望者一人为宾，次一人为介，又其次为三宾，又其次为众宾。年六十者三豆，七十者四豆，八十者五豆，九十者及主人皆六豆。主、宾、介、三宾、众宾既升，即席，工持瑟升自阶就位，鼓鹿鸣。卒歌，笙入立于堂下北面，奏南陔。乃间歌，歌南有嘉鱼，笙崇丘，乃合乐周南·关雎、召南·鹊巢。司正升自西阶，赞礼，扬觯，而戒之以忠孝之本，主、宾、介以下皆再拜。奠酬既毕，乃行无算爵，无算乐。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":25,"tongjian_id":"bca77707-db0e-11ef-9c92-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_officials":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[],"ExtRef_Children_pinyin":[],"ExtRef_Children_places":[],"ExtRef_Children_topics":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"background_material_references":[],"class_tags":["内政"],"content":"11秋，八月，頒鄕飲酒禮於州縣，令每歲十二月行之。","content_fanyi":"秋季八月，朝廷向各州县颁布乡饮酒礼，规定每年十二月举行。","content_jianti_auto":"11秋，八月，颁鄕饮酒礼于州县，令每岁十二月行之。","dtjl_paragraph_links":[],"dtjl_references":[],"id":21225,"number":11,"reading_annotation_sources":[],"start_index":10,"tongjian_id":"bca77706-db0e-11ef-ba74-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_companion_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_decisions":[],"ExtRef_Children_hu_notes":[{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[],"ExtRef_Children_places":[{"place_name":"唐","place_name_jianti_auto":"唐","start_index":0,"tongjian_id":"bca77711-db0e-11ef-978a-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"京","place_name_jianti_auto":"京","start_index":4,"tongjian_id":"bca77712-db0e-11ef-bf1e-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"唐初，在京諸司官及天下官置公廨本錢，以典史主之，收贏十之七，富戶幸免傜役，貧者破產甚衆。稱，音尺證翻。","note_content_jianti_auto":"唐初，在京诸司官及天下官置公廨本钱，以典史主之，收赢十之七，富户幸免傜役，贫者破产甚众。称，音尺证翻。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":33,"tongjian_id":"bca77710-db0e-11ef-8dd7-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[{"people_name":"沔","people_name_jianti_auto":"沔","start_index":1,"tongjian_id":"bca77714-db0e-11ef-bd19-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_places":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"時沔請計戶均出，每丁加升尺以給之。","note_content_jianti_auto":"时沔请计户均出，每丁加升尺以给之。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":67,"tongjian_id":"bca77713-db0e-11ef-b450-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_officials":[{"confidence":0.95,"official_category":"文教","official_name":"祕書少監","official_note":"祕書少監是唐代祕書省的副長官，負責圖書典籍管理，屬文教類官職。在上下文中，崔沔以此官職身份上言建議改革州縣官俸制度，顯示其參與朝政諫議的職能。此信息基於《資治通鑑》原文和唐代官制常識。","official_rank":"從四品上","source_snippet":"祕書少監崔沔上言","start_index":42,"tongjian_id":"93bd4704-4533-420a-9191-4b7a43f97d73"}],"ExtRef_Children_people":[{"people_name":"崔沔","people_name_jianti_auto":"崔沔","people_xingming":"崔沔","start_index":37,"tongjian_id":"bca77716-db0e-11ef-8974-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_pinyin":[],"ExtRef_Children_places":[{"place_name":"唐","place_name_jianti_auto":"唐","resolved_place_entity_id":44,"start_index":2,"tongjian_id":"bca77715-db0e-11ef-840b-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_topics":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"background_material_references":[],"class_tags":["内政"],"content":"12唐初，州縣官俸，皆令富戶掌錢，出息以給之；息至倍稱，多破產者。祕書少監崔沔上言，請計州縣官所得俸，於百姓常賦之外，微有所加以給之。從之。","content_fanyi":"唐初，州县官员的俸禄，都让当地富户掌管公廨本钱，靠收取利息来供给；利息高到与本钱相等，许多富户因此破产。秘书少监崔沔上书说，请求核算州县官员应得俸禄的总数，在百姓正常赋税之外略微增加征收，用来供给这些俸禄。皇上采纳了他的建议。","content_jianti_auto":"12唐初，州县官俸，皆令富户掌钱，出息以给之；息至倍称，多破产者。秘书少监崔沔上言，请计州县官所得俸，于百姓常赋之外，微有所加以给之。从之。","dtjl_paragraph_links":[],"dtjl_references":[],"id":21226,"number":12,"reading_annotation_sources":[],"start_index":11,"tongjian_id":"bca7770f-db0e-11ef-80a9-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_companion_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_decisions":[],"ExtRef_Children_hu_notes":[],"ExtRef_Children_officials":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[],"ExtRef_Children_pinyin":[],"ExtRef_Children_places":[{"place_name":"西京","place_name_jianti_auto":"西京","resolved_place_entity_id":454,"start_index":14,"tongjian_id":"bca77718-db0e-11ef-b119-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_topics":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"background_material_references":[],"class_tags":[],"content":"13冬，十一月，辛卯，車駕至西京。","content_fanyi":"冬季十一月辛卯日，皇帝车驾抵达西京长安。","content_jianti_auto":"13冬，十一月，辛卯，车驾至西京。","dtjl_paragraph_links":[],"dtjl_references":[],"id":21227,"number":13,"reading_annotation_sources":[],"start_index":12,"tongjian_id":"bca77717-db0e-11ef-a895-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_companion_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_decisions":[],"ExtRef_Children_hu_notes":[{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[{"people_name":"文成公主","people_name_jianti_auto":"文成公主","start_index":4,"tongjian_id":"bca7771b-db0e-11ef-b77c-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_places":[{"place_name":"吐蕃","place_name_jianti_auto":"吐蕃","place_note":"首都逻些城【西藏拉萨市】","start_index":0,"tongjian_id":"bca7771c-db0e-11ef-b9d7-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"唐","place_name_jianti_auto":"唐","start_index":10,"tongjian_id":"bca7771d-db0e-11ef-ad31-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"吐蕃以尚文成公主，與唐爲舅甥之國。吐，從暾入聲。","note_content_jianti_auto":"吐蕃以尚文成公主，与唐为舅甥之国。吐，从暾入声。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":20,"tongjian_id":"bca7771a-db0e-11ef-83a1-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_officials":[{"confidence":0.95,"official_category":"中枢机构","official_name":"宰相","official_note":"宰相是唐代最高行政长官，负责辅佐皇帝处理政务，此处指吐蕃和唐朝双方的宰相在誓文上署名，以加强和约的权威性。","official_rank":"正一品至正三品","source_snippet":"彼此宰相皆著名於其上","start_index":24,"tongjian_id":"3652762f-27ed-440e-b5bd-6e6e16fd1b6d"}],"ExtRef_Children_people":[],"ExtRef_Children_pinyin":[],"ExtRef_Children_places":[{"place_name":"吐蕃","place_name_jianti_auto":"吐蕃","place_note":"首都逻些城【西藏拉萨市】","resolved_place_entity_id":92,"start_index":5,"tongjian_id":"bca7771e-db0e-11ef-a9af-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_topics":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"background_material_references":[],"class_tags":["外交"],"content":"14戊辰，吐蕃奉表請和，乞舅甥親署誓文；又令彼此宰相皆著名於其上。","content_fanyi":"戊辰日，吐蕃赞普上表求和，请求作为舅甥之国的双方君主亲自签署盟誓文书，又要求两国宰相也都在誓文上署名。","content_jianti_auto":"14戊辰，吐蕃奉表请和，乞舅甥亲署誓文；又令彼此宰相皆著名于其上。","dtjl_paragraph_links":[],"dtjl_references":[],"id":21228,"number":14,"reading_annotation_sources":[],"start_index":13,"tongjian_id":"bca77719-db0e-11ef-9786-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_companion_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_decisions":[],"ExtRef_Children_hu_notes":[{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[],"ExtRef_Children_places":[{"place_name":"箕州","place_name_jianti_auto":"箕州","start_index":10,"tongjian_id":"bca77721-db0e-11ef-aa7f-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"儀州","place_name_jianti_auto":"仪州","start_index":13,"tongjian_id":"bca77722-db0e-11ef-802d-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"先天元年，避帝名，改箕州爲儀州。","note_content_jianti_auto":"先天元年，避帝名，改箕州为仪州。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":30,"tongjian_id":"bca77720-db0e-11ef-a6b9-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_officials":[{"confidence":0.9,"official_category":"地方行政","official_name":"員外司馬","official_note":"員外司馬是唐代地方州府的副職官員，通常為編制外的職位，負責輔助州長處理政務。在原文中，括州員外司馬李邕被提及為有才略文詞的人物，宋璟建議考慮其任用。","official_rank":"未知","source_snippet":"括州員外司馬李邕","start_index":6,"tongjian_id":"b0fb41b8-c697-491a-88ca-1857578acba4"},{"confidence":0.9,"official_category":"地方行政","official_name":"司馬","official_note":"司馬是唐代州府的官員，負責軍事和行政輔助事務。在原文中，儀州司馬鄭勉與李邕一同被描述為有才略文詞，宋璟對其性格提出擔憂。","official_rank":"未知","source_snippet":"儀州司馬鄭勉","start_index":15,"tongjian_id":"25777100-d2a7-4552-9bf6-9072a886052a"},{"confidence":0.9,"official_category":"地方行政","official_name":"刺史","official_note":"刺史是唐代州級行政長官，負責一州的治理和軍事。在原文中，宋璟建議任命李邕和鄭勉為渝州和硤州的刺史，以利用他們的才能。","official_rank":"未知","source_snippet":"請除渝、硤二州刺史","start_index":48,"tongjian_id":"b7eada66-1e09-488f-a5da-23f4e2e105dc"},{"confidence":0.9,"official_category":"司法","official_name":"大理卿","official_note":"大理卿是唐代最高司法機構大理寺的長官，負責審理重大案件。在原文中，元行沖被描述為素稱才行，但任職後不稱職，宋璟建議調整其職位。","official_rank":"正三品","source_snippet":"大理卿元行沖","start_index":64,"tongjian_id":"04849e1d-4899-48e3-88d8-2b13a327ee44"},{"confidence":0.9,"official_category":"中樞近臣","official_name":"左散騎常侍","official_note":"左散騎常侍是唐代門下省的官員，負責諫議和侍從皇帝。在原文中，宋璟建議將元行沖調任此職，以替換其大理卿職務。","official_rank":"從三品","source_snippet":"請復以爲左散騎常侍","start_index":88,"tongjian_id":"94dc86aa-e431-4db3-83ec-3c0f36b1a87d"},{"confidence":0.9,"official_category":"地方行政","official_name":"河南尹","official_note":"河南尹是唐代東都洛陽的行政長官，負責京畿地區的治理。在原文中，宋璟推薦陸象先擔任此職，因其閑於政體且寬容。","official_rank":"從三品","source_snippet":"請以爲河南尹","start_index":119,"tongjian_id":"b5add29f-c3c1-4249-8dae-f4ae23b3a132"}],"ExtRef_Children_people":[{"link_birth_year":663,"link_death_year":737,"link_td_description":"宋璟，邢州南和县（今河北省邢台市南和区）人，祖籍广平郡列人县（今河北省邯郸市肥乡区），为唐玄宗开元初期宰相。","link_td_id":"Q10008310","link_td_number_id":202797,"people_name":"宋璟","people_name_jianti_auto":"宋璟","people_xingming":"宋璟","start_index":2,"tongjian_id":"bca77724-db0e-11ef-8297-a0d3651f611f"},{"link_birth_year":674,"link_death_year":746,"link_td_description":"李邕，字太和，广陵江都（今江苏省扬州市）人，一说江夏咸宁（今湖北咸宁市）人，其父为文选学大家李善。曾任北海太守，故人称李北海，唐朝书法家。李邕为行书碑法大家，书法风格奇伟倜傥。传世碑刻有《麓山寺碑》、《李思训碑》等。","link_td_id":"Q10008224","link_td_number_id":144106,"people_name":"李邕","people_name_jianti_auto":"李邕","people_xingming":"李邕","start_index":13,"tongjian_id":"bca77725-db0e-11ef-ae9a-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"鄭勉","people_name_jianti_auto":"郑勉","people_xingming":"郑勉","start_index":20,"tongjian_id":"bca77726-db0e-11ef-94a0-a0d3651f611f"},{"link_birth_year":653,"link_death_year":729,"link_td_description":"元行冲，名澹，字行冲，以字行。河南郡洛阳县（今河南省洛阳市东）人。唐朝进士、官员。","link_td_id":"Q10009045","link_td_number_id":506583,"people_name":"元行沖","people_name_jianti_auto":"元行冲","people_xingming":"元行冲","start_index":82,"tongjian_id":"bca77729-db0e-11ef-9a39-a0d3651f611f"},{"link_birth_year":665,"link_death_year":734,"link_td_description":"李朝隐，字充国，京兆三原（今陕西三原县）人。","link_td_id":"Q10011544","link_td_number_id":1276888,"people_name":"李朝隱","people_name_jianti_auto":"李朝隐","people_xingming":"李朝隐","start_index":121,"tongjian_id":"bca7772a-db0e-11ef-823f-a0d3651f611f"},{"link_birth_year":665,"link_death_year":736,"link_td_description":"陆象先，本名景初，苏州吴县（今江苏省苏州市）人。陆元方之子。清净寡欲，初任扬州参军，景雲二年（711年）與崔湜同为拜相。唐睿宗为他改名象先。唐玄宗時，外放益州（今四川省），先後擔任大都督府长史、剑南道按察使，在官“以宽仁为政”。开元二十四年（736年）卒，赠尚书左丞相，谥曰文贞。","link_td_id":"Q10003486","link_td_number_id":1073393,"people_name":"陸象先","people_name_jianti_auto":"陆象先","people_xingming":"陆象先","start_index":127,"tongjian_id":"bca7772d-db0e-11ef-aa00-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_pinyin":[],"ExtRef_Children_places":[{"place_name":"括州","place_name_jianti_auto":"括州","place_note":"浙江丽水","resolved_place_entity_id":3199,"start_index":7,"tongjian_id":"bca77727-db0e-11ef-b4d8-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"儀州","place_name_jianti_auto":"仪州","place_note":"山西左权","resolved_place_entity_id":3578,"start_index":16,"tongjian_id":"bca77728-db0e-11ef-b1a8-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"渝","place_name_jianti_auto":"渝","place_note":"重庆","resolved_place_entity_id":2039,"start_index":66,"tongjian_id":"bca7772b-db0e-11ef-b95b-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"硤","place_name_jianti_auto":"硖","place_note":"湖北宜昌","resolved_place_entity_id":8524,"start_index":68,"tongjian_id":"bca7772c-db0e-11ef-ba7d-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"河南","place_name_jianti_auto":"河南","resolved_place_entity_id":176,"start_index":143,"tongjian_id":"bca7772e-db0e-11ef-8b30-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_topics":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"background_material_references":[],"class_tags":["人事"],"content":"15宋璟奏：「括州員外司馬李邕、儀州司馬鄭勉，並有才略文詞，但性多異端，好是非改變；若全引進，則咎悔必至，若長棄捐，則才用可惜，請除渝、硤二州刺史。」又奏：「大理卿元行沖素稱才行，初用之時，實允僉議；當事之後，頗非稱職，請復以爲左散騎常侍，以李朝隱代之。陸象先閑於政體，寬不容非，請以爲河南尹。」從之。","content_fanyi":"宋璟上奏说：“括州员外司马李邕、仪州司马郑勉，都有才能、谋略和文辞，只是性情多持异见，喜欢议论是非、更改旧规；如果完全引进重用，灾祸和悔恨必定会到来，如果长期弃置不用，又可惜了他们的才能，请求分别任命他们为渝、硤二州刺史。”又上奏说：“大理寺卿元行冲素来以才华品行著称，最初任用他时，确实符合众人的评议；但任事之后，很不称职，请求再任命他为左散骑常侍，用李朝隐接替其职。陆象先熟悉为政的要领，为人宽厚而不纵容过错，请求任命他为河南尹。”皇上采纳了这些建议。","content_jianti_auto":"15宋璟奏：「括州员外司马李邕、仪州司马郑勉，并有才略文词，但性多异端，好是非改变；若全引进，则咎悔必至，若长弃捐，则才用可惜，请除渝、硖二州刺史。」又奏：「大理卿元行冲素称才行，初用之时，实允佥议；当事之后，颇非称职，请复以为左散骑常侍，以李朝隐代之。陆象先闲于政体，宽不容非，请以为河南尹。」从之。","dtjl_paragraph_links":[],"dtjl_references":[],"id":21229,"number":15,"reading_annotation_sources":[],"start_index":14,"tongjian_id":"bca7771f-db0e-11ef-ad6b-a0d3651f611f"}],"reign_name":"開元六年","reign_name_jianti_auto":"开元六年","start_index":0,"tongjian_id":"bca4ca96-db0e-11ef-a5f8-a0d3651f611f","year_anno":"（戊午、七一八）","year_int":718},"message":"success","success":true}